# Maintain Mining website - environment
#
# Copy to .env.local for local development. On Vercel, set these under
# Project Settings -> Environment Variables. Nothing here is required for the
# site to build and serve.

# --- AI assistant (optional) -------------------------------------------------
# Enables the streaming assistant endpoint at /api/assistant.
# While unset the route stays disabled and answers 503 instead of pretending.
# Set this as a SECRET (never prefix it with NEXT_PUBLIC_ - that would inline it
# into the browser bundle).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Canonical site URL (optional) -------------------------------------------
# Absolute origin used by metadataBase, sitemap.xml and robots.txt.
#
# Leave this UNSET on Vercel unless you have a custom domain. lib/site.ts
# already resolves the right origin on its own:
#   production -> https://$VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL
#   preview    -> https://$VERCEL_URL   (per-deployment, and noindexed)
#   local      -> http://localhost:3000
#
# Once a real domain exists, set it here (production scope) so canonicals point
# at the domain rather than the *.vercel.app hostname. No trailing slash.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://example.com
